# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AgentPay — environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env` (server-side vars) and/or export the VITE_* values at build
# time. EVERYTHING IS OPTIONAL: the server boots and the app runs on devnet
# with zero env vars (demo agent + empty DB states). Never commit a real .env.
#
# Client vars (VITE_*) are inlined by Vite at BUILD time — changing them
# requires a rebuild (`bun run publish`). Server vars are read at runtime.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ------------------------------ Client (VITE_*) ----------------------------

# Solana network label + explorer cluster. devnet | testnet | mainnet-beta | custom.
# Mainnet is ONLY reachable by explicitly setting this — nothing hardcodes it.
# VITE_SOLANA_NETWORK=devnet

# Client RPC endpoint (devnet default).
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# USDC mint the client escrows in — MUST match server SOLANA_USDC_MINT.
# Devnet USDC default:
# VITE_USDC_MINT=4zMMC9srt5Ri5X14GAgXhaHii3GnPAEERYPJgZJDncDU

# ------------------------------ Server: Solana -----------------------------

# Server network label (informational in /api/health).
# SOLANA_NETWORK=devnet

# Server RPC endpoint (devnet default).
# SOLANA_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# USDC mint the server verifies deposits against — MUST match VITE_USDC_MINT.
# Devnet USDC default:
# SOLANA_USDC_MINT=4zMMC9srt5Ri5X14GAgXhaHii3GnPAEERYPJgZJDncDU

# ------------------------------ Server: database ---------------------------

# Neon/Postgres connection string. When unset the server runs in demo mode:
# DB-backed API routes return 503 with a clear message and pages show empty
# states. The schema (src/server/schema.ts) is applied idempotently on boot.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx.region.aws.neon.tech/agentpay?sslmode=require

# ------------------------------ Server: escrow -----------------------------

# Base58-encoded escrow secret key for managed deployments. When unset, the
# server auto-generates data/escrow.json (gitignored, 0600) on first boot.
# The private key NEVER leaves the server; only the address is exposed via
# GET /api/escrow/address.
# ESCROW_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Wallet the escrow pays when a task is approved (the agent's payout wallet).
# When unset, a devnet-only demo constant is used and labeled "demo agent
# wallet" in the UI: 9d8AnPzpHcqLLgSukdQJH6V1Dz9UA561ya6ZNPJakKQ3
# AGENT_PAYOUT_ADDRESS=

# ------------------------------ Server: LLM agent --------------------------

# Set either key to run the real AI agent. When neither is set, the agent runs
# in demo mode (deterministic, clearly-labeled result) so the whole flow works.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-haiku-latest
